I didn't take many notes on this, so this is highlights only. It's the
first time I've had a character past both the mines and sokoban
(normally I manage YASD somewhere down the bottom of the mines). The
RNG helped too.

Started with a wand of speed and a scrollbook of cure sickness among
other things. Got reflection from Sokoban, and then made it down to
mines end where I found a bag of holding, and managed to get a pet
grey dragon from a polymorph trap. Got magicbane, a bunch of
spellbooks, and then myself crowned on about dlvl10 when I found an
altar to convert. A couple of levels further down a wand of wishing
(0:1) was just lying around and gave me SDSM, Helm of Brilliance, and
some magic markers which I first used to write + of magic missile.

I nearly managed YASD at this point. I'd found a ring of polymorph,
and thought I'd use it with the  SDSM to lay some eggs and get some
more pets. Unfortunately I did this on a cleared out level in a locked
empty room with all my food and my ring of slow digestion in the bag
of holding. Nearly starved to death (fainted several times from
hunger) even after eating the eggs I'd just laid while waiting to turn
back into something with hands and get some food out of the bag. Also
prayed when I thought I was about to die, angered Anhur, and lost all
my protection. After eating I tried again and descended through the
rest of the dungeon with three pet dragons.

The Quest and castle were both easy with these. Wishes for gauntlets
of dexterity and more magic markers from the castle wand got my AC
down to -34 before entering the Valley of the Dead at XL14. Used the
Eye of Aethiopica  to take an incubus back to Sokoban to get XL up to
30, and then polypiled for a shirt of all things to get AC down to -42
where it stayed. Did a bit of Alchemy and nurse dancing (again in
Sokoban with a cursed ?oG) to get up the HP as well.

The rest of it was trouble free. Orcus, Baalzebub, and Vlad went down
to c corpses. Asmodeus died fairly easily to  magicbane and magic
missile. I managed to lose my finger of death spellbook and the spell
had worn out so wasted a wish on another one and used it to take out
Rodney.

Rodney only reappeared twice during the ascension run, and got finger
of death both times. Spent some time recuperating in a shocking vortex
on the Plane of Air after HP dropped to nearly 250, but otherwise no
trouble there. The Astral Plane was a little scary, but picked the
right altar first time (finger of Death to Famine), and

